  "description": "TOON (Token-Oriented Object Notation) serialization for .NET, implementing TOON spec v4.4 (all 564 official conformance fixtures pass; output identical to the official library). Fast System.Text.Json-style ToonSerializer with a source generator, cached metadata and compiled accessors, async and multi-document streaming, and a ToonDocument/ToonValue model. Useful for compact, LLM-friendly payloads, configuration files and data exchange.",
